## GNOME Keyring-derived patch

`patches/0001-escape-multiline-textual-secrets.patch` targets the GNOME Keyring
files `pkcs11/secret-store/gkm-secret-textual.c` and
`pkcs11/secret-store/test-secret-textual.c` from the Ubuntu source package
`gnome-keyring 46.1-2ubuntu0.2` and `gnome-keyring 50.0-1`.

