future releases.

## Verification keys

`keys/gnome-keyring-46.1-source-signer.asc` and
`keys/gnome-keyring-50.0-source-signer.asc` are the public keys used to verify
the respective signed Debian source control files. Each target profile pins
its expected signer fingerprint; no secret key or account credential is included.
